# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# ECO375 term project - files kept OUT of GitHub
# GitHub rejects files over 100 MB, so the large data lives outside the repo
# (share it via OneDrive / Google Drive). Everything else is tracked.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------

# Original datasets (too large; each groupmate keeps a local copy)
News Data Set/nasdaq_exteral_data.csv
News Data Set/All_external.csv
News Data Set/news_price_matched.csv
News Data Set/full_history.zip
News Data Set/cache/
Twitter Data Set/full_dataset-release.csv

# Large or intermediate build outputs (rebuild with the Panel Build scripts)
# daily panels are pushed as compressed .csv.gz (the plain .csv is over GitHub's 100 MB limit)
Panel Build/data/panel_daily_*.csv
Panel Build/data/panel_weekly_base.csv
Panel Build/data/panel_weekly_full.csv
Panel Build/data/news_ticker_day.csv
Panel Build/data/news_daily_*.csv
Panel Build/data/news_weekly_*.csv
Panel Build/data/news_monthly_*.csv
Panel Build/data/*_NEW.csv
Panel Build/data/_05_work/
Panel Build/data/_07_parts/
Panel Build/data/_superseded_rawfile/
Panel Build/data/_to_delete/
Panel Build/data/parts/
Panel Build/raw/

